      </div>
      <div id="bottom-cta-start" class="hidden">
        <a href="/courses/credit-fundamentals/understanding-your-credit-score/" class="inline-block rounded-lg bg-primary px-8 py-3.5 text-base font-semibold text-white hover:bg-primary/90 transition-colors">Start Module 1</a>
        <p class="mt-3 text-xs text-muted">You're enrolled. Pick up where you left off.</p>
